      "volumeId": "frus1949v07p2",
      "documentId": "d386",
      "text": "A considerably expanded information program both in Communist and non-Communist areas of Asia is called for, both to demonstrate our understanding and sympathy for the nationalist aspirations of the Asian peoples and to expose the menace to these aspirations created by Soviet imperialism."
    },
